  "content": "[Intro]\n[Em]\n[Gmaj7]  [Gmaj7/D]\n[Eb]\n[Gm]  [Bb]\n[Em]\n[Gmaj7]  [Gmaj7/D]\n[Eb]\n[Gm]  [Bb]\n[Bbm/Db]\n[Bbm/F]  [Bbdim/Fb]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[B5]The distortion,\n[D5]ceremonial\n[B5]Apathy\n[D5]shaped like a [Gb5]cage [F5]\n[B5]The poisonous\n[D5]cauldron\n[B5]Emptied with feverish\n[D5]rage [Gb5][F5]\n[D5]As transparency tears\n[Db5]\n[D5]Through the dead,\n[A5]pungent [Ab5]air\n[D5]Like storms from the\n[Db5]dying past\n[D5]Frozen circles of\n[A5]timeless [Ab5]despair\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G]In a\n[Em]blur of black [D]wings\n[Bm]They storm\nout of the [A]past\n[G]In-\n[Em]fested with the [D]promise of death\n[Bm]In-\nfested with [A]eternal death\n\n[Intrelude]\n[Em]\n[Gmaj7]  [Gmaj7/D]\n[Eb]\n[Gm]  [Bb]\n[Em]\n[Gmaj7]  [Gmaj7/D]\n[Eb]\n[Gm]  [Bb]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[B5]The procession\n[D5]never ending\n[B5]The fatalistic void\n[D5]  [Gb5]  [F5]\n[B5]In oblivion\n[D5]cloaked\n[B5]Men forever\n[D5]shaped out of [Gb5]clay [F5]\n[D5]In blind hal-\n[Db5]lucination\n[D5]Their irreversible truth\n[A5]  [Ab5]\n[D5]Rituals\n[Db5]hedonistic\n[D5]Resignation de-\n[A5]signed from [Ab5]above\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G]In a\n[Em]blur of black [D]wings\n[Bm]They storm\nout of the [A]past\n[G]In-\n[Em]fested with [D]eternal death\n[Bm]\n[A]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]In a\n[Em]blur of black [D]wings\n[Bm]They storm\nout of the [A]past\n[G]In-\n[Em]fested with the [D]promise of death\n[Bm]In-\nfested with [A]eternal death\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[Em7]  [Em6]\n[Em]  [Em6]\n[Em7][Em6]Per-\n[A]fection dressed in crippled dreams\n[B5]\n[Em7]  [Em6]\n[Em]Dead [Em6]rhythms,\n[Em7]  [Em6]\n[A]sharpened to the ob-\n\n[Solo 1]\n[B5]scene\n[Eb5]\n[B5]\nOn\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[F]fevered wings\n[Fadd#11]A-\n[Dm]wakened from our\n[Am]nameless sleep\n\n[Solo 2]\n[B5]\nOn\n\n[Bridge 3]\n[F]fevered wings\n[Fadd#11]Eternal\n[Dm]death, to the\n[Am]lords of the keep\n\n[Solo 3]\n[Bmadd9]\n[D]\n[A/Db]\n[C]\n[Gb]\n\n[Outro]\n[Em7][Em6]In a\n[Gb]blur of black wings\n[D]They storm\n[A/Db]out of the past\n[G]In-\n[Gb7/Bb]fested with eternal death\n[Bm]\n[Em7][Em6]In a\n[Gb]blur of black wings\n[D]They storm\n[A/Db]out of the past\n[G]In-\n[Gb7/Bb]fested with the promise of\n[Bm]death",
